<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 13:25:02 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>定义内源性 DMT 脑生物型：多模式神经影像研究</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/defining-endogenous-dmt-brain-biotypes-a-multi-modal-neuroimaging-study</link><description>你的大脑有自己的“DMT 签名”吗？一项新的研究计划旨在找出答案。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/defining-endogenous-dmt-brain-biotypes-a-multi-modal-neuroimaging-study2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 13:25:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/defining-endogenous-dmt-brain-biotypes-a-multi-modal-neuroimaging-study</guid></item><item><title>埃隆·马斯克 (Elon Musk) 更新了 SpaceX 前往火星的时间表</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/elon-musk-updates-the-spacex-timeline-for-mars</link><description>埃隆·马斯克更新了人类何时在火星上行走以及船只何时到达那里的时间表。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/elon-musk-updates-the-spacex-timeline-for-mars.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 13:10:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/elon-musk-updates-the-spacex-timeline-for-mars</guid></item><item><title>通过数十亿个立方体的训练在 Minecraft 中实现梦想立方体可控生成模型</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/dream-cubed-controllable-generative-modeling-in-minecraft-by-training-on-billions-of-cubes</link><description>当没有新数据时，开发人员通常会转向“派生”数据——要么在多轮训练中循环使用相同的文本（多时期重复），要么使用人工智能重新措辞（释义）。为了衡量其效果如何，研究人员引入了一个称为代币有效性（$\eta$）的概念。将其视为一个价值分数：一个完全新鲜的原始单词得到 1.0，而重复或改写的标记可能得分较低，具体取决于它对模型的有用程度。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/dream-cubed-controllable-generative-modeling-in-minecraft-by-training-on-billions-of-cubes2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 12:55:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/dream-cubed-controllable-generative-modeling-in-minecraft-by-training-on-billions-of-cubes</guid></item><item><title>微型红外芯片可以改善气体和热量的检测</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/tiny-infrared-chip-could-improve-detection-of-gases-and-heat</link><description>红外热像仪可用于发现我们的眼睛看不到的有用信息，例如从管道中逸出的气体、大气中的化学物质或从建筑物中泄漏的热量。但以复杂的方式感测红外光仍然需要昂贵且庞大的系统。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/tiny-infrared-chip-could-improve-detection-of-gases-and-heat.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 12:40:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/tiny-infrared-chip-could-improve-detection-of-gases-and-heat</guid></item><item><title>走神机制会根据眼睛状态而变化</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/mind-wandering-mechanisms-change-depending-on-eye-state</link><description>一种与觉醒和注意力相关的大脑活动可以追踪走神行为。但关于这种活动是否促进或阻碍走神的研究存在争议。巴纳德学院的埃丝特·蒂尔金（Esther Thielking）及其同事研究了睁眼或闭眼是否会改变这种大脑活动与走神之间的关系。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/mind-wandering-mechanisms-change-depending-on-eye-state3.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 12:25:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/mind-wandering-mechanisms-change-depending-on-eye-state</guid></item><item><title>绘制细胞内蛋白质接触位点揭示了甲型流感病毒感染期间副斑点的劫持</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/mapping-incell-protein-contact-sites-reveals-hijacking-of-paraspeckles-during-influenza-a-virus-infection-microbiology</link><description>细胞内交联质谱分析绘制了感染流感的人类细胞中的蛋白质接触图，揭示了病毒如何劫持宿主膜运输因子并拆除核副斑点以增强复制。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/mapping-incell-protein-contact-sites-reveals-hijacking-of-paraspeckles-during-influenza-a-virus-infection-microbiology2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 12:10:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/mapping-incell-protein-contact-sites-reveals-hijacking-of-paraspeckles-during-influenza-a-virus-infection-microbiology</guid></item><item><title>科学家实现阿秒显微镜分辨率来捕捉电子运动</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/scientists-achieve-attosecond-microscope-resolution-to-capture-electron-motion</link><description>在这位艺术家的构想中，电子波包（蓝色）位于空间和时间的边界。扫描隧道显微镜尖端和金属样品之间会产生仅持续阿秒的电子闪光。研究人员使用精确控制的红外光脉冲来触发闪光灯。图片：布拉德·巴克斯利&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-achieve-attosecond-microscope-resolution-to-capture-electron-motion2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 11:55:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/scientists-achieve-attosecond-microscope-resolution-to-capture-electron-motion</guid></item><item><title>最后！ 20年后，重大量子纠缠理论已被实验证实</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/finally-after-20-years-major-quantum-entanglement-theory-has-been-experimentally-confirmed</link><description>量子力学是如此奇怪，即使是描述宇宙秘密的有远见的天才&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/finally-after-20-years-major-quantum-entanglement-theory-has-been-experimentally-confirmed.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 11:40:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/finally-after-20-years-major-quantum-entanglement-theory-has-been-experimentally-confirmed</guid></item><item><title>钙泵 ATP2B1/PMCA1 通过促进 Norrin Frizzled4 信号传导调节 CNS 血管发育</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/the-calcium-pump-atp2b1-pmca1-regulates-cns-vascular-development-by-facilitating-norrin-frizzled4-signaling</link><description>乔等人。确定质膜 Ca2+−泵 ATP2B1/PMCA1 作为中枢神经系统血管系统中内皮 Norrin/Frizzled4 和 Wnt 信号传导的调节剂。 ATP2B1 的缺失会升高细胞内 Ca2+ 并激活 NFAT，抑制 β-连环蛋白信号传导并将 Ca2+ 稳态与血管生成和血脑屏障完整性联系起来。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-calcium-pump-atp2b1-pmca1-regulates-cns-vascular-development-by-facilitating-norrin-frizzled4-signaling2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 11:25:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/the-calcium-pump-atp2b1-pmca1-regulates-cns-vascular-development-by-facilitating-norrin-frizzled4-signaling</guid></item><item><title>生物陶瓷涂层植入物通过定时释放镁来改善骨质疏松性骨折愈合</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/bioceramic-coated-implant-improves-osteoporotic-fracture-healing-through-timed-magnesium-release</link><description>首尔国立大学 (SNU) 工程学院宣布，化学与生物工程系教授 Nathaniel S. Hwang 领导的研究小组开发出了一种生物陶瓷骨折固定材料，该材料通过精确控制镁离子 (Mg²⁺) 释放的时间来抑制骨质疏松性骨折愈合过程中的炎症免疫反应，从而促进骨再生。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/bioceramic-coated-implant-improves-osteoporotic-fracture-healing-through-timed-magnesium-release2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 11:10:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/bioceramic-coated-implant-improves-osteoporotic-fracture-healing-through-timed-magnesium-release</guid></item></channel></rss>